IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. CRD0033.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-INPUT.
    05 CREDIT-SCORE       PIC 9(3).
    05 GROSS-INCOME       PIC 9(7)V99.
    05 PROC-DATE          PIC 9(8).
    05 PROC-DATE-R REDEFINES PROC-DATE.
       10 PROC-DATE-YYYY  PIC 9(4).
       10 PROC-DATE-MM    PIC 9(2).
       10 PROC-DATE-DD    PIC 9(2).
    05 FILLER             PIC X(2).
01 OUT-RECORD.
    05 APPROVED-LIMIT     PIC 9(7)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
0000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT WS-INPUT
    PERFORM 3000-CREDIT-LIMIT
    DISPLAY "APPROVED-LIMIT=" APPROVED-LIMIT
    STOP RUN.
3000-CREDIT-LIMIT.
    IF CREDIT-SCORE NOT LESS THAN 760
        COMPUTE APPROVED-LIMIT ROUNDED = GROSS-INCOME * 0.30
    ELSE IF CREDIT-SCORE >= 680
        COMPUTE APPROVED-LIMIT ROUNDED = GROSS-INCOME * 0.15
    ELSE
        MOVE 1000 TO APPROVED-LIMIT
    END-IF
    END-IF.
